@startuml transfer-robustness
' ============================================================
' 图 2-7 本行转账鲁棒图（与 B 的类模型对齐，单页紧凑版）
' 对应用例：UC-TR-03 行内转账
' 负责人：C（交易与风控域）
' 说明：类名、实体字段按 B《交接D》；AccessService/IdempotencyService 复用 B 的控制类。
' ============================================================
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam nodesep 15
skinparam ranksep 20
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam boundary {
  BackgroundColor #FFF4E6
  BorderColor #D97706
}
skinparam control {
  BackgroundColor #EBF4FF
  BorderColor #4A90D9
}
skinparam entity {
  BackgroundColor #F0FFF4
  BorderColor #38A169
}

title 图 2-7 本行转账鲁棒图（UC-TR-03）

package "边界层" {
  boundary "转账表单\nTransferForm" as TransferForm
  boundary "转账接口\nTransferController" as TransferController
}

package "控制层" {
  control "转账服务\nTransferService" as TransferService
  control "风控校验\nRiskCheckService" as RiskCheckService
  control "资金提交\nPostingService" as PostingService
}

package "实体层" {
  entity "付款账户\nAccount" as PayerAccount
  entity "收款账户\nAccount" as PayeeAccount
  entity "交易\nTransaction" as Transaction
  entity "转账单\nTransferOrder" as TransferOrder
  entity "资金流水\nFundEntry" as FundEntry
  entity "风控规则\nRiskRule" as RiskRule
  entity "风险事件\nRiskEvent" as RiskEvent
}

TransferForm --> TransferController : submitTransfer()
TransferController --> TransferService : createTransfer()
TransferService --> RiskCheckService : checkOutgoing()
TransferService --> PostingService : reserve / post / release
TransferService --> Transaction : 状态推进
TransferService --> TransferOrder : 创建转账单
RiskCheckService --> PayerAccount : 读状态与限额
RiskCheckService --> PayeeAccount : 读状态
RiskCheckService --> RiskRule : evaluateOutgoing()
RiskCheckService --> RiskEvent : 命中留痕
PostingService --> PayerAccount : reserve / debitReserved / release
PostingService --> PayeeAccount : credit
PostingService --> FundEntry : debitOf / creditOf
PostingService --> Transaction : markProcessing / markSucceeded

note right of TransferService
  AccessService / IdempotencyService
  复用 B 的控制类：
  权限先于幂等，幂等先于资金动作。
  边界类不得直接连实体类。
end note

note bottom of RiskCheckService
  状态(BR-03) → 单笔(BR-05/06)
  → 日累计(BR-05/07)；
  拒绝写 RiskEvent，不写 FundEntry(BR-19)。
end note

@enduml
